bove 李录's 1.95. Hmm. Is that a problem? The task says data/valuation/conclusions should align, but each view has its own methodology. The Buffett view's H1+H2 build-up (H1中值1.05 + H2 +20% yoy = 1.28) gives 2.33亿. That's a justifiable methodology. 华泰 2.31 is close to 2.33. So 基准 2.33 is fine and evidence-backed.\n\nBut the resulting 中枢 27.1 and 建仓 23 are the alignment anchors that the other views have already adopted (商业模式 aligned to them today; 综合研判 median 24/20.8 is in the same ballpark). Good.\n\nOne consideration: 芒格's 建仓 25.5 and 李录's 21.4 remain different in their own files. But per the task's principle, \"除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\" — 芒格 argues price already deeply discounted (内在涨幅中枢+5%, 建仓 25.5 = 2026E 2.25亿×18x), 李录 demands 20% safety margin (21.4). Both have stated rationale. The 财务估值 view: 23 = 中枢 27.1 × 0.85 (15% margin), TTM 17.6x. The team-lead median across final four: 23. So the Buffett view aligns with the consensus; the other two deviate with justification. That satisfies the task.\n\nAlternatively, should I make the Buffett 建仓 exactly the cross-view median 24? Hmm. The 综合研判 says 建仓 24 = median of 21.4/23/25.0/25.5. But after 商业模式's alignment to 23, the median becomes 23. And the Buffett view's own methodology gives 23 (中枢×0.85). Using 24 would actually contradict the Buffett view's own 19th-round file. I'll go with 23 — it aligns with the latest 商业模式 aligned version (the most recent alignment done today) and the Buffett view's own 19th-round computation. Also note the 综合研判's 稳健型 suggests \"24 元附近\" for the aggregate, which is close to 23 (within ~4%).\n\nHmm, wait. Actually, let me reconsider whether the target should be 23/20 or something else. Let me re-read the task once more:\n\n\"重写 reports/001316润贝航科-财务估值-巴菲特视角.md，使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐：同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点。保持 财务估值 视角的分析立场与方法论，但数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告。\"\n\n\"其他三份最新报告\" — for the 财务估值 rewrite, the three other views' latest reports are:\n- 商业模式-段永平视角: the aligned version (non-dated, update